# Cloudflare Pages — SPA fallback.
#
# Pages Functions (functions/api/*) match before this, so /api/* still reaches
# the Hono app and returns JSON 404s rather than the HTML shell. Everything
# else serves index.html so React Router can resolve the path, which is what
# keeps deep links like /progress alive through a hard refresh.
#
# `wrangler pages dev` prints "Infinite loop detected in this rule and has
# been ignored" for this line, because the destination /index.html also
# matches /*. It is safe: locally Pages' built-in SPA handling already serves
# the shell (verified — deep links return 200 text/html), and in production
# this is Cloudflare's documented SPA rule.
/*    /index.html   200
